<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Miami Cty, Kan., sale for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Miami Cty, Kan., sale for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified $2.31 million Miami County, Kan., bonds for insurance.</p>
<p>The offering is scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
